# Licences

This repository holds two different things under two different licences: code
written for this project, and LDraw data redistributed from elsewhere. The split
matters, because the second is not this project's to relicense.

## The code: MIT

Everything in `src/`, `scripts/`, `demo-models/`, and the configuration at the
repository root.

